1
00:01:26,160 --> 00:01:27,200
You want to kill me,

2
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:28,640
Tang Zhiluo.

3
00:01:29,600 --> 00:01:31,680
I am Luo Shuyan, the adopted daughter of the Shang family.

4
00:01:31,680 --> 00:01:33,140
I am not Tang Zhiluo at all.

5
00:01:33,320 --> 00:01:34,479
Then do it.

6
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:38,759
Zhiluo, Zhiluo.

7
00:01:53,320 --> 00:01:56,680
It seems your appointment was not pleasant, Princess.

8
00:01:57,920 --> 00:02:00,050
Are you laughing at me, Your Highness?

9
00:02:00,920 --> 00:02:01,850
I wouldn't dare.

10
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:05,010
I just want to remind you, Princess Xiyao,

11
00:02:05,720 --> 00:02:08,050
that you are not only Princess Consort Yu,

12
00:02:08,199 --> 00:02:10,130
but also Princess Xiyao of Rouran.

13
00:02:11,760 --> 00:02:13,040
You are all

14
00:02:13,040 --> 00:02:15,000
sanctimonious hypocrites.

15
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:17,660
You keep talking about the greater good,

16
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:20,530
but you push the fate of the country onto me alone.

17
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:23,240
Is it to cover up your incompetence?

18
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:30,570
Instead of getting angry here, Princess,

19
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:33,440
you might as well think about how to proceed

20
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:36,760
to break free from the shackles of fate.

21
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:39,420
It's getting late.

22
00:02:41,040 --> 00:02:42,170
I will take my leave.

23
00:03:12,880 --> 00:03:16,610
Your Highness specifically asked for this box as part of the dowry.

24
00:03:17,760 --> 00:03:18,560
It seems

25
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:22,160
I should congratulate Your Highness on getting what you wanted.

26
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:25,060
It seems the Princess has figured it out.

27
00:03:28,200 --> 00:03:29,530
Your Highness is right.

28
00:03:30,760 --> 00:03:34,240
How I proceed from now on is entirely up to me.

29
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:44,800
Why are you in such a hurry to reconcile with me?

30
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:47,690
Your Highness doesn't need to test me.

31
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:50,800
I sincerely want to cooperate with Your Highness.

32
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:54,079
You get the throne,

33
00:03:54,160 --> 00:03:55,400
and I get my freedom.

34
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:00,330
The Princess is indeed a sensible person.

35
00:04:17,839 --> 00:04:18,700
I've found out.

36
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:20,160
More than a month ago,

37
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:21,399
Shang Zaiyi bought

38
00:04:21,399 --> 00:04:22,840
a dying Tang Zhiluo from human traffickers

39
00:04:22,840 --> 00:04:24,000
and adopted her as his daughter.

40
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:25,460
What an adopted daughter.

41
00:04:26,280 --> 00:04:28,400
She's just his killing tool.

42
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:31,280
Jingxuan, stay calm.

43
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:32,880
You care too much about Tang Zhiluo.

44
00:04:32,880 --> 00:04:34,400
They seized this weakness,

45
00:04:34,400 --> 00:04:36,000
trying one scheme after another.

46
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:38,040
They just want you to, after losing the Soul Jade,

47
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:39,000
lose your mind.

48
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:40,840
I understand.

49
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:42,680
Don't worry.

50
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:47,800
Jingxuan,

51
00:04:48,159 --> 00:04:50,820
if you can't have both the empire and the beauty,

52
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:52,520
how will you choose?

53
00:04:52,520 --> 00:04:53,520
Enough, Su Zhiye.

54
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:56,820
You can't expect everyone to be like you.

55
00:05:04,320 --> 00:05:05,760
Sorry, I didn't mean that.

56
00:05:05,760 --> 00:05:06,560
You're right.

57
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:13,400
Remember to take your medicine.

58
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:16,600
Although it can't completely replace the Soul Jade,

59
00:05:16,600 --> 00:05:18,000
it can keep you lucid.

60
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:22,360
The postponement of the crown prince ceremony

61
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:23,560
is a good thing for us.

62
00:05:23,760 --> 00:05:25,360
If we don't eliminate Prince Yu and the Shang family,

63
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:28,160
your position as the crown prince won't be secure.

64
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:46,980
Your Highness.

65
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:49,420
These are pills I specially made.

66
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:52,400
By the way, I added honey to them.

67
00:05:52,400 --> 00:05:53,530
They are not bitter.

68
00:05:54,240 --> 00:05:56,170
Who said I'm afraid of bitterness?

69
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:28,400
Tang Zhiluo.

70
00:06:30,640 --> 00:06:31,720
Do you know?

71
00:06:33,320 --> 00:06:34,400
I used to

72
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:38,880
never be afraid of bitterness.

73
00:06:40,560 --> 00:06:41,880
But after meeting you,

74
00:06:43,680 --> 00:06:45,400
I became cautious.

75
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:49,570
So you have to take responsibility for me.

76
00:06:51,760 --> 00:06:52,640
I beg you.

77
00:06:52,640 --> 00:06:54,240
Please don't leave me again.

78
00:07:03,680 --> 00:07:05,280
As long as you don't leave me,

79
00:07:07,640 --> 00:07:09,170
I'm willing to do anything.

80
00:07:26,320 --> 00:07:27,440
Prince Shuo has caught a cold

81
00:07:27,440 --> 00:07:29,040
and is not receiving guests.

82
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:30,840
Prince and Princess Yu,

83
00:07:30,840 --> 00:07:31,640
please come back another day.

84
00:07:31,640 --> 00:07:34,080
We came to visit our sixth brother.

85
00:07:35,520 --> 00:07:37,520
Since he doesn't want to see guests,

86
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:39,120
we can come back another day.

87
00:07:41,640 --> 00:07:44,440
Then please give this to our sixth brother, Mr. Su.

88
00:07:46,680 --> 00:07:49,140
I thank Princess Yu on behalf of Prince Shuo.

89
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:50,720
Thank you, Mr. Su.

90
00:08:21,320 --> 00:08:22,960
Su Zhiye seems unreliable,

91
00:08:23,280 --> 00:08:25,000
but he is actually very cautious.

92
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:27,260
He won't give the item to Yuwen Jingxuan.

93
00:08:28,040 --> 00:08:28,840
What?

94
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:32,919
Am I that naive in your eyes, Princess?

95
00:08:35,080 --> 00:08:36,840
You used me as a decoy

96
00:08:36,880 --> 00:08:38,340
to achieve your own goals.

97
00:08:40,960 --> 00:08:43,090
Who taught you to use idioms like that?

98
00:08:44,400 --> 00:08:45,760
But it's close enough.

99
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:49,200
I just put a few Gu worms

100
00:08:49,200 --> 00:08:50,720
on Su Zhiye.

101
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:52,840
What Gu worms?

102
00:08:54,560 --> 00:08:55,890
Don't worry, Princess.

103
00:08:56,520 --> 00:08:57,920
They won't hurt Su Zhiye.

104
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:01,920
You overthink it, Your Highness.

105
00:09:01,920 --> 00:09:03,320
That's not what I meant.

106
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:06,650
Don't worry, Princess.

107
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:09,200
I'm just using the Gu worms on him

108
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:12,560
to make the medicine Yuwen Jingxuan is taking

109
00:09:12,560 --> 00:09:13,720
lose its effect.

110
00:09:17,920 --> 00:09:19,050
Since we are allies,

111
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:21,810
listen to my advice, Princess.

112
00:09:23,640 --> 00:09:25,120
If you want to live freely,

113
00:09:26,080 --> 00:09:27,940
don't care too much about others.

114
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:31,450
If you want to live long,

115
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:34,370
don't leave yourself any weaknesses.

116
00:09:39,280 --> 00:09:41,210
Princess, you don't need to be sad.

117
00:09:41,560 --> 00:09:43,620
Although I can't be your sweetheart,

118
00:09:45,160 --> 00:09:46,320
I can be your ally.

119
00:10:07,040 --> 00:10:08,040
Jingxuan, Jingxuan.

120
00:10:08,040 --> 00:10:10,200
Wake up, Jingxuan. Jingxuan.

121
00:10:13,320 --> 00:10:14,040
How many times have I told you

122
00:10:14,040 --> 00:10:14,720
not to stand behind me?

123
00:10:14,720 --> 00:10:15,360
Where is Tang Zhiluo?
